{"version":1,"content":"<p>任天堂Switch 2問世後不久出現的首個破解方案，正在催生越來越令人意外的技術實驗。繼自製軟件開發、遊戲數據挖掘、PC模擬器研究以及DLSS相關測試之後，一名開發者近日展示了更為大膽的成果：成功將原本面向Switch 2的平台獨佔遊戲移植到性能明顯落後的初代Nintendo Switch上運行。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584860.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:56.592623+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:14:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.136653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.136653+00:00","content_hash":"6ee833cf33f996e0ed0b4e744472a3979e011f587764eeeadcf1ca76739bdfc9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}